---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';

const PAGE_TITLE = 'Tank Royale | Steven Brennan';
const PAGE_DESCRIPTION = 'Tank Royale project page showcasing gameplay programming work, technical highlights, and development experience.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={PAGE_TITLE} description={PAGE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main id="main">
			<section class="project-hero" aria-labelledby="project-title">
				<video
					class="project-hero-video"
					poster="/poster.png"
					autoplay
					muted
					loop
					playsinline
					preload="none"
					aria-hidden="true"
				>
					<source src="/TankGameplayLoop.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
				</video>

				<div class="project-hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

				<div class="project-hero-content">
					<img
						class="project-title-image"
						src="/TankTitleCard.png"
						alt="Tank Royale title card"
					/>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section">
				<h2 class="sr-only" id="project-title">Tank Royale</h2>
				<p class="project-summary">Fight your way through waves of tanks who just keep coming... and coming.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="video-title">
				<div class="project-video-wrap">
					<iframe
						class="project-video"
						src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/iTMZuCJv6oM?autoplay=1&mute=1&rel=0&playsinline=1"
						title="Tank Royale gameplay video"
						allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
						allowfullscreen
					></iframe>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="skills-title">
				<h2 id="skills-title">Skills Used:</h2>
				<div class="project-tags">
					<span class="project-tag">Unity</span>
					<span class="project-tag">C#</span>
					<span class="project-tag">Gameplay Programming</span>
					<span class="project-tag">Systems Design</span>
					<span class="project-tag">AI and Navmesh integration</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
				<h2 id="overview-title">Overview</h2>
				<p>This was my first ever Unity project outside of University studies. I mostly used it as a way to keep the things I
				had previously learnt fresh and to just make something over Summer.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="worked-on-title">
				<h2 id="worked-on-title">What I worked on</h2>
				<ul class="project-list">
					<li>Everything, except the Sprites. Wish I could make Sprites that cool.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="challenges-title">
				<h2 id="challenges-title">What I learnt:</h2>
				<p>Looking back at it, I mostly learnt how not to write clean code from this project. I was writing spaghetti code
				and polling booleans back and forth all over the place back then. Not good. Now I know much better.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="links-title">
				<h2 id="links-title">Game Build:</h2>
				<ul class="project-links">
					<li>
						<a href="https://steveybr.itch.io/tank-royale" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
							Itch.io build <p> though, I'd recommend playing </p> <a href="https://stevenbrennandev.com/projects/hardwhere/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> HardWhere? </a> <p> or something instead... </p>
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.project-hero {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 18px;
		border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
		background: var(--content-bg, transparent);
		width: min(1100px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		min-height: 300px;
	}

	.project-hero-video {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		filter: blur(5px) brightness(0.55) saturate(1.1);
		transform: scale(1.08);
	}

	.project-hero-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25));
	}

	.project-hero-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 300px;
		padding: 1.5rem;
	}

	.project-title-image {
		display: block;
		max-width: min(82%, 680px);
		max-height: 200px;
		width: auto;
		height: auto;
		object-fit: contain;
	}

	.project-section {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.project-summary {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 850px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.project-video-wrap {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		border-radius: 16px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		background: #000;
	}

	.project-video {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 0;
	}

	.project-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.project-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(35, 55, 255, 0.12);
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(35, 55, 255, 0.18);
	}

	.project-list,
	.project-links {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}

	pre {
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		overflow-x: auto;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
		background: transparent;
	}

	pre code {
		font-size: inherit;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.project-hero {
			padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
			min-height: 220px;
		}

		.project-hero-content {
			min-height: 220px;
			padding: 1rem;
		}

		.project-title-image {
			max-width: 90%;
			max-height: 120px;
		}
	}
</style>